* The number of squarefree divisors of ` N ` is ` 2 ^ omega ( N ) ` : ` sum_ ( d || N ) | mu ( d ) | = 2 ^ omega ( N ) ` ( ~ sqff1o , ~ hashpw , ~ fsumconst ).

